.TH WAYBAR\-THEME\-STATUS 1 "2026-06-19" "paperweight-skel 0.2.57" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
waybar\-theme\-status \- waybar custom module for theme-switch status
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B waybar\-theme\-status
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B waybar\-theme\-status
is a waybar
.I custom/exec
module that emits a JSON status object.
.PP
When no theme switch is in progress it outputs an empty JSON object so
the module shows nothing.
When
.BR paperweight-theme (1)
is running, it outputs a Braille spinner frame and the target theme name
as a tooltip, allowing waybar to display a visual indicator during the
switch.
.SH OUTPUT
JSON with the following keys:
.TP
.B text
Empty string when idle; a Braille spinner character while switching.
.TP
.B tooltip
Empty string when idle;
.RI \*(lq Switching\ to:\ <theme> \*(rq
while switching.
.TP
.B class
Empty string when idle;
.I theme-switching
while switching (for CSS targeting in waybar).
.SH FILES
.TP
.I ~/.local/share/paperweight-os/theme-switch.status
Written by
.BR paperweight-theme (1)
while a switch is in progress; removed on completion.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR paperweight-theme (1)
